<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF385C 0%, #c0073d 100%);
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-hero p {
    opacity: 0.88;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }
  .legal-toc {
    background: var(--slate-50, #F8FAFC);
    border: 1px solid var(--slate-200, #E2E8F0);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-toc {
    background: #141C2C;
    border-color: #1E293B;
  }
  .legal-toc h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--slate-800); }
  .legal-toc ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .legal-toc ol li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .legal-toc ol li a { color: #FF385C; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.93rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .legal-toc ol li a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .legal-section { margin-bottom: 3rem; scroll-margin-top: 100px; }
  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--slate-900);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #FF385C;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-section h2 { color: #F1F5F9; }
  .legal-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--slate-800);
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-section h3 { color: #CBD5E1; }
  .legal-section p, .legal-section li {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--slate-600);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-section p,
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-section li { color: #94A3B8; }
  .legal-section ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .legal-section ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

  .legal-highlight-box {
    background: rgba(255,56,92,0.07);
    border-left: 4px solid #FF385C;
    border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.4rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--slate-700);
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-highlight-box { background: rgba(255,56,92,0.12); color: #CBD5E1; }

  .legal-contact-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,56,92,0.08), rgba(255,56,92,0.03));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,56,92,0.2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-contact-card { background: rgba(255,56,92,0.08); border-color: rgba(255,56,92,0.25); }
  .legal-contact-card h3 { font-weight: 700; color: var(--slate-900); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-contact-card h3 { color: #F1F5F9; }
  .legal-contact-card p { color: var(--slate-600); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  [data-theme="dark"] .legal-contact-card p { color: #94A3B8; }
  .legal-contact-card a { color: #FF385C; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .legal-contact-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .legal-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
    background: rgba(255,56,92,0.1); color: #FF385C;
    border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>

<!-- Hero -->
<div class="legal-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: August 17, 2026 &nbsp;•&nbsp; Effective: August 17, 2026</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="legal-container">

  <!-- Table of Contents -->
  <div class="legal-toc">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-list me-2" style="color:#FF385C"></i>Table of Contents</h2>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#information-collect">Information We Collect</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how-we-use">How We Use Your Information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#sharing">Sharing of Information</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cookies">Cookies & Tracking Technologies</a></li>
      <li><a href="#data-security">Data Security</a></li>
      <li><a href="#your-rights">Your Rights & Choices</a></li>
      <li><a href="#third-party">Third-Party Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#children">Children's Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#retention">Data Retention</a></li>
      <li><a href="#changes">Changes to This Policy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact-privacy">Contact Us</a></li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="legal-highlight-box">
    <strong>Your privacy matters to us.</strong> At Rentrova, we are committed to protecting your personal information and being transparent about how we collect, use, and share it. Please read this policy carefully before using our platform.
  </div>

  <!-- 1 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="information-collect">
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <h3>1.1 Information You Provide Directly</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> When you register, we collect your name, email address, password, and profile details.</li>
      <li><strong>Listing Information:</strong> When you create a listing, we collect property details, photos, pricing, and location.</li>
      <li><strong>Booking & Payment:</strong> We collect booking dates, guest count, and payment information. Payment transactions are processed securely through Razorpay and we do not store your full card details.</li>
      <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Messages sent to hosts/guests through our platform, reviews, and support requests.</li>
      <li><strong>Identity Verification:</strong> Government-issued ID or other verification documents when required.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>1.2 Information Collected Automatically</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, search queries, listing views, booking activity, and session duration.</li>
      <li><strong>Device & Log Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, referring URLs, and timestamps.</li>
      <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Approximate geographic location based on IP address, or precise location if you grant permission.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies & Similar Technologies:</strong> See Section 4 for details.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>1.3 Information from Third Parties</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Payment processors (Razorpay) for transaction verification.</li>
      <li>Identity verification services to confirm host/guest authenticity.</li>
      <li>Social media platforms if you link your account or use social login.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- 2 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="how-we-use">
    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate and improve the Rentrova platform and services.</li>
      <li>Process bookings, payments, and communicate booking confirmations.</li>
      <li>Verify your identity and authenticate your account.</li>
      <li>Connect hosts and guests and facilitate communication between them.</li>
      <li>Send transactional emails (booking confirmations, payment receipts, cancellation notices).</li>
      <li>Send promotional communications and newsletters (you may opt out at any time).</li>
      <li>Personalise your experience and surface relevant listings.</li>
      <li>Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, security threats, and illegal activity.</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms of Service.</li>
      <li>Conduct analytics, research, and improve our recommendation algorithms.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="legal-highlight-box">
      <strong>Legal Basis (India):</strong> We process your data under the Information Technology (Amendment) Act, 2008 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023. Our processing is based on your consent, contract performance, legal obligation, and legitimate business interest.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="sharing">
    <h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information. We may share it only in the following circumstances:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Between Hosts & Guests:</strong> Necessary booking details (name, approximate location, contact) are shared to facilitate stays.</li>
      <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Trusted third-party vendors that assist in payment processing (Razorpay), email delivery, cloud hosting, analytics, and fraud detection — all under strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> If required by law, court order, or government authority.</li>
      <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In case of a merger, acquisition, or sale of company assets, your data may be transferred with notice to you.</li>
      <li><strong>With Your Consent:</strong> For any other purpose with your explicit consent.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- 4 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="cookies">
    <h2>4. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>Rentrova uses the following types of cookies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for authentication, security, and core functionality (e.g., session cookies).</li>
      <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Store your theme preference (dark/light mode) and language settings via <code>localStorage</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how users interact with the platform (e.g., page views, click paths).</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing Cookies:</strong> Used to display relevant promotions. You may opt out via your browser settings.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling essential cookies may affect platform functionality.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 5 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="data-security">
    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>HTTPS/TLS encryption for all data in transit.</li>
      <li>Bcrypt hashing for passwords — we never store plaintext passwords.</li>
      <li>HMAC-SHA256 signature verification for all payment transactions via Razorpay.</li>
      <li>MongoDB Atlas cloud database with access control and encryption at rest.</li>
      <li>Regular security audits, vulnerability assessments, and penetration testing.</li>
      <li>Role-based access control for all internal systems.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="legal-highlight-box">
      No system is 100% secure. If you suspect unauthorised access to your account, please contact us immediately at <strong>privacy@rentrova.in</strong>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 6 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="your-rights">
    <h2>6. Your Rights & Choices</h2>
    <p>Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (India), you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
      <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your account and associated personal data.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Receive your data in a structured, commonly used format.</li>
      <li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Opt out of marketing communications at any time.</li>
      <li><strong>Grievance Redressal:</strong> Lodge a complaint with our Grievance Officer (details below).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@rentrova.in" style="color:#FF385C">privacy@rentrova.in</a> or write to our Grievance Officer.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 7 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="third-party">
    <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>Rentrova integrates with the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Razorpay</strong> — Payment processing (<a href="https://razorpay.com/privacy/" target="_blank" style="color:#FF385C">razorpay.com/privacy</a>)</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudinary / Cloud Storage</strong> — Image hosting and delivery</li>
      <li><strong>OpenStreetMap / Nominatim</strong> — Mapping and geocoding services</li>
      <li><strong>MongoDB Atlas</strong> — Cloud database hosting (<a href="https://www.mongodb.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" style="color:#FF385C">MongoDB Privacy Policy</a>)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party services. We encourage you to review their policies independently.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 8 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="children">
    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Rentrova is not intended for persons under the age of <strong>18 years</strong>. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors. If we become aware that a child under 18 has provided us with personal information, we will delete it promptly. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us immediately.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 9 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="retention">
    <h2>9. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your personal information for as long as:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your account is active or as needed to provide services.</li>
      <li>Required by applicable law, regulation, or legal proceedings.</li>
      <li>Necessary for legitimate business purposes (e.g., fraud prevention, tax compliance).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Upon account deletion, your personal data will be anonymised or deleted within <strong>30 days</strong>, except where retention is required by law.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 10 -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="changes">
    <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. When we make significant changes, we will:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page.</li>
      <li>Notify registered users via email or an in-app notification.</li>
      <li>Request renewed consent where required by law.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Continued use of the Rentrova platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- 11 Contact -->
  <div class="legal-section" id="contact-privacy">
    <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related queries, complaints, or requests, please contact:</p>
    <div class="legal-contact-card">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield me-2" style="color:#FF385C"></i>Grievance Officer — Rentrova</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@rentrova.in">privacy@rentrova.in</a><br>
        <strong>Address:</strong> Rentrova Inc., India<br>
        <strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 30 days of receipt of your request
      </p>
      <a href="/terms" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm mt-2 me-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract me-1"></i>Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm mt-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass me-1"></i>Back to Listings</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
